sentences.text:
There is no dispute that the claimant in a road accident dated 17.08.2011 sustained following injuries:
(a) Right segmental sub trochanteric femur fracture;
(b) Right transverse patella fracture;
(c) Right un-displaced tibia condyle fracture;
 (d) Left tibia condyle fracture;
 (e) Left tibia and fibula fracture;
 NC: 2025:KHC-K:1509-DB (f) Left 3rd proximal phalanx fracture and other grevious injuries all over the body.
